{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b9f8f98f87db41c9","name":"Rangefinder","source":{"id":"source:reference-b9f8f98f87db41c9","title":"Rangefinder","revision":19741,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:31:38Z","sha256":"6c3240fb950bfc730d76a7b360033355050c32a8ad7e77bad91f0514212f9a82","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19741","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Rangefinder&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b9f8f98f87db41c9","blocks":[{"tag":"h4","children":["Weapon Upgrade"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Any ranged weapon can have a Rangefinder built into it. Such a weapon takes no penalty when used to attack a target at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". Thus, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:38dcc06542ba096c"}," with a Rangefinder Upgrade takes no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalty on attacks against targets up to 40 squares away.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This is essentially an improved version of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"},", and thus its benefits do not stack with those of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scopes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scopes"},". (However, a weapon can have both a Rangefinder and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"},", using the latter only when ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aiming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aiming"}," at targets at Medium or Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Armor Upgrade"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Rangefinder built into a suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," works like a weapon Rangefinder, but it applies only to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b"}," made by weapons built into the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Mount"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Mount","referenceId":"reference:a72098d1ceb6e9ee"},". Its benefits apply to other ranged weapons only if you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," immediately before making the attack.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Any attack using a Rangefinder takes no penalty when used against a target at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". Thus, if your suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," had a Rangefinder and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:38dcc06542ba096c"}," built into a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Mount"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Mount","referenceId":"reference:a72098d1ceb6e9ee"},", you would take no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalty on attacks against targets up to 40 squares away.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
